"""packs/economics.py — the economics specialization.

Covers: Economics, Development Economics, Co-operative Economics,
Agricultural Economics (theory courses) and Political Economy-adjacent
courses. The {S} slot fills with phrases like "economics",
"co-operative economics", "development economics".

Every atom teaches real economic theory with Nigerian grounding. Quiz
items whose answers are numeric (equilibrium price, elasticity, cost
tables, GDP by three approaches, multiplier, CPI, terms of trade,
tariff welfare, exchange-rate arithmetic) were verified with real
Python arithmetic before being keyed.
"""

